The MIT License in LICENSE covers the code in this repository: everything under
tools/ and .github/, and the documentation.

It does not cover the data.

  archive/**.pdf   Published by State Bank of India. Redistributed unmodified
                   so that every extracted number can be traced to the document
                   it came from. Copyright remains with SBI.

  data/, api/      Figures extracted from those PDFs. The underlying facts are
                   SBI's published rates; the extraction, schema and tooling are
                   covered by LICENSE.

PDFs dated before September 2026 were imported from
https://github.com/skbly7/sbi-tt-rates-historical, which has collected them
since June 2020.

This is an unofficial project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by State Bank of India. The rates are indicative; the PDFs themselves
state that the applicable rate is the one prevailing at the time of
debit or credit. Do not rely on this data for settlement.
